{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"8b257a194f7a8d57e28ab9ea56319b21803221d5d7649f1ce515e813125aa826","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"880a05d14dd0e1e2f2d677d7be7e7509ca30c757edee987b52130e013f716cad","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源文触发条件为 Your successful melee hits；ashes-urhrok oppression.lua（未固定来源，sha256 4df44bc8…与 workset 一致）Horrifying Blows 用 callbackOnMeleeAttack 且 if not hitted then return end，仅近战命中触发。译文“你的攻击能够惊吓目标”删去“近战”与“命中”限定，把触发范围扩大到任意攻击/未命中，机制描述失真。"},{"revision_key":"886c20b244c332eb87da191b9a3bf3a4d334fc5a687f39a08ee89657b6206aff","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"89a4d5c92f7bfb07b70e633da61369d3eaa0590de614f5fc9766ad0afe8c039b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源文 \"For the demon who has everything.\" 化用礼品广告语“送给应有尽有的人”（world-artifacts.lua:589 The Black Crown 的 desc，带引号）。译文“魔中之魔，加冕为王”意为“众魔之魔，加冕称王”，原句“送给已拥有一切的恶魔”的含义完全丢失，引号也被删去。"},{"revision_key":"8c1bab1ad29bdca0dad216ec4ccd0002ff571f66185f4714b4dac13f35593b03","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8cc43b0e6eb5adc24ad822b8109d48b9adbd4fe87dcc2666cefdd002cbe93c0f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d7b289755999deb531b03fdccfdd78457befa42639193acbe806c93dcd79397","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8dcc6c29ec0a5c3df731b97815851977f1ca4156579c334fedbfef28057e3ed6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8ead5856883742dd1b169b8f6b082084cab2b6267e17e0311a4bbfc6934dae5f","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"unlock-race_doomelf.lua:24（未固定来源）说的是 thus have earned the right to make Doomelf characters，即解锁可创建魔化精灵角色；译文改成“#LIGHT_GREEN#魔化精灵#WHITE# 应运而生”，丢失“获得创建该种族角色的资格”这一解锁含义。另外“有关埃亚尔大陆的真相”在源文中没有依据，源文只说 the truth。"},{"revision_key":"90ae8f40d2a08477d67d7ed14e25ed88e91a0ae157afbfebc4cc2d78631b314a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"919188331c9705e5513c95c4ac838bb6784603b07ed4c98064b2fb24b0eba746","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"952fa9c1b8869a78fcf5b0cdc2b2a12b2770f674f72df625096c4d9c778f8d7a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"958319eb5e7461315b275db2517c2c0c18881434160ba7f249e8cf19c3ab155f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"9ac85a7a89f1ebd76f9f78a9fb05df008a23bdd9b228b0ac3d118ceaa4b43205","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"walrog-pop.lua:49-53（未固定来源）第一句 scowl. 之后有换行再接 #AQUAMARINE#；译文“皱了皱眉#AQUAMARINE#”漏掉这个 \\n，违反换行不变量。另外 Your 'loyalty...' would give me their fate 意为“你的‘忠诚’会让我落得和他们（纳鲁精灵/乌克勒姆斯维奇）一样的下场”，译文“还能骗得了谁？”没有表达“他们的下场”这层意思，属语义偏离。"},{"revision_key":"9d7afbedda50e66336107bbedb083a220fc84cd3e62776304cbdcfe82ae5d793","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"world-artifacts.lua:788（The Black Maul）的 unided_name 为 massive black hammer，只说是黑色，源码中这件物品没有 obsidian 材质描述（同文件把 obsidian 明确用在 Black Crown 的 cracked obsidian crown 上）。译文“黑曜石战锤”添加了源文没有的材质。"},{"revision_key":"9e25a17b1f561701bcaf00ec558056deef43d8ed17f80126826dd6ed08468c1b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"9e32f9dfdf50858636c3279f5638c34f257df75e051ed6af5f5ecf3277695db5","verdict":"OK"}]}